{
  "name": "MultiExtractor — Site ENEL",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Site ENEL\n\nLogin no Site ENEL (reCAPTCHA pelo **CapSolver**, chave no worker) e PDF da fatura pela API da área privada. `uc` opcional (sem ela, a conta padrão do login); `referencia` opcional (padrão: mês atual); `tipo_conta`: `empresa` | `residencial`.\n\n**POST** `/webhook/enel/site-enel`  \nHeader: a chave da credencial *MultiExtractor API Key*\n\n```json\n{\n  \"usuario\": \"login@empresa.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"senha\",\n  \"uc\": \"12345678\",\n  \"referencia\": \"07/2026\",\n  \"tipo_conta\": \"empresa\"\n}\n```\n\nResposta: `status` = `sucesso` | `atencao` | `erro`, `observacao` e `arquivos[]` com `pdf_base64` de cada fatura.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "032873db-e12f-5926-ac03-c33eb4f7b966",
      "name": "Como usar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "enel/site-enel",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4aa064e6-8e4c-5afc-b9d3-ede778486df9",
      "name": "Receber pedido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "webhookId": "3d392242-6188-5e78-9c06-abdfd6096527",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "multiextractor-api-key",
          "name": "MultiExtractor API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://worker:8000/extracoes/site-enel",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          },
          "timeout": 1800000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}"
      },
      "id": "f34250de-a4be-528e-a8a4-88d3ed34c810",
      "name": "Extrair no worker",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        160
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body ?? { status: 'erro', observacao: 'Worker indisponível: ' + ($json.error?.message ?? 'sem resposta') }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": "={{ $json.statusCode ?? 502 }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "fc2fa45b-c433-59c7-9501-407ae9cb46af",
      "name": "Responder resultado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        160
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Receber pedido": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extrair no worker",
